        "strengths": "Ambitious, enthusiastic and decisive; at its best when a situation calls for a leader.",
        "caution": "Pride and impatience with slower minds. Demanding a lot of others without asking what they need."
      },
      "snake": {
        "name": "Snake",
        "character": "Calm and perceptive, the Snake thinks before it moves and sees what others miss.",
        "strengths": "Wise, intuitive and elegant; discreet with secrets and precise in its judgement.",
        "caution": "Secrecy, suspicion and possessiveness. Holding a grudge quietly is still holding it."
      },
      "horse": {
        "name": "Horse",
        "character": "Lively and independent, the Horse needs space, movement and a goal to run towards.",
        "strengths": "Energetic, sociable and hard-working; quick to learn and good at getting others moving.",
        "caution": "Impatience and fickleness. Dropping a project the moment it stops being exciting."
      },
      "goat": {
        "name": "Goat",
        "character": "Kind and imaginative, the Goat, also called the Sheep, lives through feeling and beauty.",
        "strengths": "Compassionate, artistic and gentle; creates warmth and cares for the people around it.",
        "caution": "Worry and indecision, and leaning on others for security. Needs to trust its own choices."
      },
      "monkey": {
        "name": "Monkey",
        "character": "Clever and playful, the Monkey solves problems in ways nobody else thought of.",
        "strengths": "Inventive, adaptable and witty; learns fast and handles change with ease.",
        "caution": "Scattered attention and a taste for shortcuts. Cleverness used to outsmart people wears out goodwill."
      },
      "rooster": {
        "name": "Rooster",
        "character": "Observant and precise, the Rooster notices details and says what it thinks.",
        "strengths": "Honest, diligent and organised; takes pride in doing things properly.",
        "caution": "Bluntness and perfectionism. Criticism that is accurate can still be more than a person needs to hear."
      },
      "dog": {
        "name": "Dog",
        "character": "Loyal and principled, the Dog stands by its people and by what it believes is right.",
        "strengths": "Honest, protective and fair; a trustworthy friend who defends the underdog.",
        "caution": "Anxiety and pessimism, and a fixed first judgement of people. Not every risk needs guarding against."
      },
      "pig": {
        "name": "Pig",
        "character": "Warm and sincere, the Pig enjoys life and assumes the best of people.",
        "strengths": "Generous, easygoing and honest; a reliable friend who shares what it has.",
        "caution": "Naivety and overindulgence. Avoiding confrontation until a small problem has grown."
      }
    },
    "elements": {
